Subject: [PATCH] now-playing: request 8 forecast days from Open-Meteo (restores TODAY + 7)

The provider migration in 1.1.x silently lost a forecast day. 1.0.6 fetched
OpenWeatherMap's daily array (8 entries) and dropped the leading one:

    return forecast.slice(1); // First day of forecast is actually current day

...which left TODAY + 7 forecast days for the client. The Open-Meteo rewrite
dropped that compensation and requests only 7 days, so the client renders
TODAY + 6 (7 columns).

Open-Meteo supports up to 16 days, so requesting 8 restores the previous display
without any client change.

--- a/src/lib/api/open-meteo/index.ts
+++ b/src/lib/api/open-meteo/index.ts
@@ -126,7 +126,7 @@
         daily: ["temperature_2m_max", "temperature_2m_min", "weather_code", "wind_speed_10m_max", "relative_humidity_2m_mean"],
         hourly: ["temperature_2m", "relative_humidity_2m", "wind_speed_10m", "weather_code", "is_day"],
         current: ["temperature_2m", "relative_humidity_2m", "wind_speed_10m", "weather_code", "is_day"],
-        forecast_days: 7,
+        forecast_days: 8,
         forecast_hours: 24,
         wind_speed_unit: __classPrivateFieldGet(this, _OpenMeteoAPI_units, "f") === 'metric' ? 'ms' : 'mph',
         temperature_unit: __classPrivateFieldGet(this, _OpenMeteoAPI_units, "f") === 'metric' ? 'celsius' : 'fahrenheit',

--- a/dist/lib/api/open-meteo/index.js
+++ b/dist/lib/api/open-meteo/index.js
@@ -129,7 +129,7 @@
         daily: ["temperature_2m_max", "temperature_2m_min", "weather_code", "wind_speed_10m_max", "relative_humidity_2m_mean"],
         hourly: ["temperature_2m", "relative_humidity_2m", "wind_speed_10m", "weather_code", "is_day"],
         current: ["temperature_2m", "relative_humidity_2m", "wind_speed_10m", "weather_code", "is_day"],
-        forecast_days: 7,
+        forecast_days: 8,
         forecast_hours: 24,
         wind_speed_unit: __classPrivateFieldGet(this, _OpenMeteoAPI_units, "f") === 'metric' ? 'ms' : 'mph',
         temperature_unit: __classPrivateFieldGet(this, _OpenMeteoAPI_units, "f") === 'metric' ? 'celsius' : 'fahrenheit',
